# oc-sim scenario v1
# The Ratchet applet (journal/D-032): open the app menu, move the highlight down
# three times to RATCHET, launch it, then send one 2 ms trigger on TR1. The
# snapshot is taken during the burst: the trigger light 1 is off, the
# settings show their defaults (4 repeats, 100 ms, shape 0.0, 100 %).
ticks 400
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
160 button left down
166 button left up
200 trigger 1 high
202 trigger 1 low
